End of term touches exams, reports, accounting and the calendar. The order matters because each step
consumes the one before it.

## 1. Finish the exams

All results entered and saved, for every class and subject.

- [Enter Exam Results](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-enter-exam-results)
- [Upload Results from a Spreadsheet](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-upload-exam-results)

Clear the queue in **Exams → Result Changes** before moving on. An unapproved change request is a
mark that is about to move — and progress reports are built from marks.

## 2. Check the rankings

**Exams → Rankings**. This is a sanity check as much as an output: a ranking that looks wrong usually
means a subject is missing marks for part of a class, or an exam was created with the wrong
**Exam Type** — only TERM exams feed term rankings. See
[Create an Exam](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-create-an-exam).

## 3. Progress reports

Teachers fill them in, then they are published as a batch.

- [Write and Publish Progress Reports](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-progress-reports)
- [Teachers: Write Progress Reports](/docs/educonnect-teacher-progress-reports)

Publish once the whole cohort is complete. Publishing is what parents see.

## 4. Attendance

Before quoting term attendance to anyone, confirm the calendar was right — unconfigured holidays and
term breaks depress every percentage. See
[Set Holidays, Terms and Working Days](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-holidays-and-terms).

Then take the term views from **Attendance → Reports** and the per-class term summaries.

## 5. Close the books

1. Every day of the term [closed](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-day-close).
2. [Reconciliation](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-reconciliation) worked until every tab is zero, or
   every remaining row is one you have deliberately kept.
3. Invoices issued from **Accounting → Invoices**.
4. Expiring [discount grants](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-discounts) reviewed — scholarships that
   ended, siblings who have left.

Reconcile before issuing invoices, not after.

## 6. Roll the calendar forward

- Next term's dates and holidays in.
- Next term's [fee schedules](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-fee-setup) — **Duplicate** the current ones
  and change the label, amount and due date.
- Timetable changes, if the shape of the week is changing —
  [regenerate](/docs/educonnect-tutorial-generate-timetable) in **Preview only** first.

